    {
      "text": "You got that look I can’t ignore\n",
      "start": 25.68,
      "end": 28.54
    },
    {
      "text": "Barefoot dancing on my bedroom floor\n",
      "start": 28.54,
      "end": 30.76
    },
    {
      "text": "We keep on saying this is the last time\n",
      "start": 30.76,
      "end": 33.3
    },
    {
      "text": "But we both know that’s another lie\n",
      "start": 33.3,
      "end": 35.34
    },
    {
      "text": "And I don’t wanna think too much\n",
      "start": 35.34,
      "end": 37.54
    },
    {
      "text": "When you’re this close, when you’re this close\n",
      "start": 37.54,
      "end": 39.86
    },
    {
      "text": "Maybe we’re just bad at love\n",
      "start": 39.86,
      "end": 42.06
    },
    {
      "text": "But I can’t let you go\n",
