      "end": 44.86
    },
    {
      "text": "It’s a midnight call\n",
      "start": 44.86,
      "end": 46.16
    },
    {
      "text": "And I’m coming over\n",
      "start": 47.36,
      "end": 49.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Even if we fall\n",
      "start": 49.4,
      "end": 50.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Even if it’s over\n",
      "start": 52.06,
      "end": 54.0
    },
    {
      "text": "You know I can’t resist\n",
      "start": 54.0,
      "end": 56.06
    },
    {
      "text": "The way you pull me closer\n",
      "start": 56.06,
